WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.765
- Have you, have y'all met before?

00:00:01.765 --> 00:00:02.917
(crowd cheering and clapping)

00:00:02.917 --> 00:00:04.770
- No, but (laughing)
- We haven't...

00:00:04.770 --> 00:00:07.080
- I have this thing where I
have amnesia with famous people.

00:00:07.080 --> 00:00:08.342
So I...

00:00:08.342 --> 00:00:09.619
- We may well of that we
have actually (laughs).

00:00:09.619 --> 00:00:11.190
- I, well we might have met,
and if I see you again...

00:00:11.190 --> 00:00:12.480
- Wait, have y'all met?

00:00:12.480 --> 00:00:13.313
- [Eddie Redmayne] No...
- [Emily Deschanel] No.

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:14.146
- I don't really...
(Kelly claps and laughs)

00:00:14.146 --> 00:00:15.750
but I'm so thrilled to
hear that you have amnesia,

00:00:15.750 --> 00:00:17.640
'cause I have, like, a brain like a sieve.

00:00:17.640 --> 00:00:19.620
And so I have exactly the same thing

00:00:19.620 --> 00:00:20.730
and it's horrendously offensive

00:00:20.730 --> 00:00:21.693
to people who I've actually met.

00:00:21.693 --> 00:00:22.526
(Emily laughs)

00:00:22.526 --> 00:00:23.359
- I know people get very
offended when you don't remember.

00:00:23.359 --> 00:00:24.192
And it's like, Oh my God,

00:00:24.192 --> 00:00:25.080
there's so many people in the world.

00:00:25.080 --> 00:00:26.130
I'm so sorry.
(Eddie and audience laughs)

00:00:26.130 --> 00:00:27.300
- It's, I, I think I have

00:00:27.300 --> 00:00:29.280
like this thing where I
hold people up to this.

00:00:29.280 --> 00:00:31.447
I, I, I met Seth Rogen and I was like,

00:00:31.447 --> 00:00:32.280
"So nice to meet you."

00:00:32.280 --> 00:00:33.300
And he's like, "Well, we've met before."

00:00:33.300 --> 00:00:34.133
And I was like...
- Oh.

00:00:34.133 --> 00:00:34.966
- Oh, really?

00:00:34.966 --> 00:00:35.850
And he's like, "Yeah, remember we met

00:00:35.850 --> 00:00:37.620
at the audition for '40-Year-Old Virgin'?"

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.757
And I was like, "No, nope."
(Eddie and audience laughs)

00:00:39.757 --> 00:00:40.950
"I didn't audition for that.

00:00:40.950 --> 00:00:43.013
I don't know what you're talking about."

00:00:43.013 --> 00:00:43.846
- [Kelly] Oh.

00:00:43.846 --> 00:00:45.675
- And then, like three weeks
later I was like, "I did."

00:00:45.675 --> 00:00:46.508
(Eddie laughs)

00:00:46.508 --> 00:00:47.755
"I did audition for that movie."

00:00:47.755 --> 00:00:48.588
(Kelly and audience laughs)

00:00:48.588 --> 00:00:49.470
And it's happened several times,

00:00:49.470 --> 00:00:51.337
but I've been savvier and just been like,

00:00:51.337 --> 00:00:52.170
"Yes..."

00:00:52.170 --> 00:00:53.003
- Amazing.

00:00:53.003 --> 00:00:54.105
- "It's so nice to see you again."

00:00:54.105 --> 00:00:54.938
- Exactly, "To see you."

00:00:54.938 --> 00:00:55.771
- See you.

00:00:55.771 --> 00:00:56.604
To...
- [Emily And Kelly} See you.

00:00:56.604 --> 00:00:58.677
It was very helpful, "Lovely to see you."

00:00:58.677 --> 00:00:59.510
(Emily laughing)

00:00:59.510 --> 00:01:00.480
- Anyway. But I don't ever get offended.

00:01:00.480 --> 00:01:01.672
If you don't remember this
moment, I will just...

00:01:01.672 --> 00:01:02.670
- [Emily Deschanel] I think...

00:01:02.670 --> 00:01:03.503
- Not care.

00:01:03.503 --> 00:01:04.336
- [Emily] I think I will.
(audience laughing)

00:01:04.336 --> 00:01:05.997
- Yeah. I'll be like, "Cool, me neither."

